# Inkpath

#PK#Vector#= **Inkpath** is a vector graphics editor with box selection, live Bézier point dragging, and panning and zooming around the canvas. Drawings are saved as `.kv` files and export as SVG or PNG!

[Open Inkpath](/inkpath) · [Phone version](/inkpath/mobile/)


::divider{wavy|Inkpath|red}
## Drawing tools

* #R.prism(Selection) with a drag box for several shapes at once!
* #O.prism(Path tools) with real-time Bézier node dragging, and a #PR.pixel(knife) for cutting!
* #GL.prism(Gradient tool) (press #PR.pixel(G)) with fill-line handles. Hold Shift to snap!
* #Y.prism(Rulers, guides and snapping), plus #PR.pixel(align), #PR.pixel(layers) and #PR.pixel(artboards)!

## Blur Behind

#Y.pixel(Blur Behind) turns a shape into frosted glass by blurring everything behind it. The effect survives export!

## Animation

The #C.pixel(Animate) panel adds keyframes:

1. Set a keyframe!
2. Move a shape!
3. Move the playhead and set another keyframe!

You can also use presets like Fade in, Spin or Bounce. Export an SVG that plays by itself in any browser!

## Saving and exporting

Choose **File > Export** for SVG or PNG. Extra SVG features such as caps, dashes, markers, patterns, blend modes, groups and images are supported!
